# ACCOUNT INFORMATION
IMAPAccount ezequielcardoso@gmail.com
Host imap.gmail.com
User ezequielcardoso@gmail.com
#Pass xwkhlknrnylwtayg
PassCmd "gpg -q --for-your-eyes-only --no-tty -d ~/.authinfo.gpg | awk '/^machine imap\\.gmail\\.com/ {print $6; exit}'"
#PassCmd "gpg -q --for-your-eyes-only --no-tty -d ~/.authinfo.gpg | awk '/://gmail.com/ {print $6}'"
AuthMechs LOGIN
TLSType IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt

IMAPStore ezequielcardoso@gmail.com-remote
Account ezequielcardoso@gmail.com

MaildirStore ezequielcardoso@gmail.com-local
Path ~/Maildir/
Inbox ~/Maildir/Inbox
Subfolders Verbatim

Channel ezequielcardoso@gmail.com
Far :ezequielcardoso@gmail.com-remote:
Near :ezequielcardoso@gmail.com-local:
# Patrones corregidos para mapear las carpetas esenciales que mu4e requiere de Gmail
Patterns "INBOX" "[Gmail]/Sent Mail" "[Gmail]/Drafts" "[Gmail]/Bin" "[Gmail]/All Mail"
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *

